+# TLS Verification Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included, with no exception for development. This sits alongside the recorded decision to use HTTPS everywhere with no exceptions, so development builds are not to fall back to plain HTTP or to skip certificate checks.
